  "notes": "fwd_call forwards rdi and rsi to narrow by a call (sub rsp,8; call; add rsp,8; ret), fwd_call2 by a call to fwd_call: their callers pass both on, as the caller of the jmp-forwarder fwd does. fwd_clob writes esi before its call, so its caller passes rdi only. Controls gain nothing: fwd_ind calls through a pointer, cyc_a/cyc_b call each other and read nothing.",
